<table  width="100%" border=2 bordercolor="black" bordercolordark="#333333" bordercolorlight="#666666" cellpadding=3 background="gray.gif"><tr>	<td><FONT face="Arial" size="2"><BR><B><U>TDE Owns Joo!</U></B><br> <small>-<b>Xian</b> : Wednesday, January 17, 2001</small><br><br><FONT face="Arial" size="2">I got a nice email this last week explaining that TDE (The Dark Exile) has taken it upon themselves to own Cazic-Thule in Fear. It was told to me by a source within TDE that they know exactly when he pops every week and they try and maintain his pops during the week to lessen the chance of another guild taking him down. It was also told to me by this inside source of TDE that they will not partake in any Raid boards and refuse to recognize any other guilds holding over a spawn, even if they are in the zone preparing to take it down. Not being a player of Seventh Hammer keep in mind I can only confirm this with players who have emailed me (One of them being a member of TDE).<br><br>I am a bit appalled by this policy being set by TDE and who knows maybe another guild will see this post and help break this chain of TDE owning Cazic-Thule!<br><br><a href="http://forums.gamerealm.com/cgi-bin/showflat.pl?Cat=75,76,77,45,46&Board=newscomments7th&Number=18437&page=0&view=collapsed&sb=5&part=&vc=">Comments</a>?<br></FONT> <font size="-1"><center><a href="#top">-Top-</a></font></center></td></tr></table><br>
